<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech June unemployment rate edges up to 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech June unemployment rate edges up to 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic totalled 202,562, or 4.0 percent of the workforce in June, the Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs said on Monday.</p>
<p>The number of unemployed in May was 193,442, or 3.8 perecnt of the workforce.  </p>
<p> CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT	 JUNE 1997    MAY 1997   JUNE 1996</p>
<p>  total jobless		202,562     193,442     144,065</p>
<p>  percentage of workforce    4.0	   3.8	   2.7</p>
<p>NOTE. Measures through end of period listed.</p>
<p>-- Alan Crosby, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
